        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 471112, Tuscany Monolithic Entry Door Handleset with Covered Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Tuscany Monolithic Handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-7/8 inches thick. Choose from either a flat black bronze finish or a medium bronze finish. This Tuscany Entry Door Handleset with Covered Deadbolt is available as a dummy function and a single cylinder function. It is available with your choice of interior tim lever of knob. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Lost Wax Cast Bronze Tuscany Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Tuscany Entrance Handleset with Covered Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Mount Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Mount Width: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3-9/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Top Plate Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Top Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-7/8\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Deadbolt and Lever Latch: 5-1/2\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 9-7/16\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-470112-specifications.pdf?v=1704262356\"><b>Emtek 471112 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-C-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262297\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-lost-wax-finish.jpg?v=1704354555\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Tuscany Monolithic Handleset",
                "description": "The Tuscany Monolithic Handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-7/8 inches thick. Choose from either a flat black bronze finish or a medium bronze finish. This Tuscany Entry Door Handleset with Covered Deadbolt is available as a dummy function and a single cylinder function. It is available with your choice of interior tim lever of knob. \r\n",
                "keywords": "Cast Bronze Tuscany Entry Door Handlesets, Tuscany Monolithic Handlesets, Emtek 471112, Emtek 470112, Emtek Tuscany Entrance Handleset with Covered Deadbolts, Lost Wax Cast Bronze Tuscany Tubular Handlesets, Tuscany Monolithic Entry Door Handleset with Covered Deadbolts,"
